Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:55:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/47] ipu: align with driver with baseline.

- align ipu7 with 495acc9
- align ipu6 with a810b67
- align with scaling repo release/26Q2.1

Signed-off-by: syafiqnizam25 <muhammadsyafiqnizamuddinx.binshafie@intel.com>
